{"id": "14-768-2-2", "zh": "第二品", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-769-2-10", "zh": "12，13．元音在元音前脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-770-2-8", "zh": "元音在后接元音时脱落。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-771-2-4", "zh": "如：yassindriyāni samathaṅgatāni（他的诸根已趋于寂止）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "14-771-5-10", "zh": "no hetaṃ bhante（不是这样的，尊者）；sametāyasmā saṅghena（尊者，请与僧团和合）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-772-2-10", "zh": "13，15．在不同类的元音之后，后面的元音可选地脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-773-2-9", "zh": "在不同类的元音之后，后面的元音可选地脱落。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-774-2-11", "zh": "如：cattāro ’me bhikkhave dhammā（比丘们，这四法）；kinnu ’māva samaṇiyo（这些莫非是沙门尼？）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-774-12-14", "zh": "为什么说“可选”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-774-15-21", "zh": "如：pañcindriyāni（五根）；tayassu dhammā jahitā bhavanti（这三法已被舍弃）。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "14-775-2-10", "zh": "14，16．前元音脱落时，后元音有时变为不同类的元音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-776-2-10", "zh": "前面的元音脱落时，后面的元音有时变为不同类的元音。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-777-2-8", "zh": "如：saṅkhyaṃ nopeti vedagū（通达者不落入名数）；bandhusseva samāgamo（就像与亲人相聚）。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "14-778-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**有时**”？", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-778-6-11", "zh": "如：yassindriyāni（他的诸根）；tathūpamaṃ dhammavaraṃ adesayi（他宣说了具有这样譬喻的殊胜之法）。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "14-779-2-8", "zh": "15，17．变为长音。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-780-2-10", "zh": "前面的元音脱落时，后面的元音有时变为长音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-780-11-18", "zh": "如：saddhīdha vittaṃ purisassa seṭṭhaṃ（在这世间，信是人最上的财富）；anāgārehi cūbhayaṃ（也不与出家人交往，两者都不）。", "confidence": 62}
{"id": "14-781-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**有时**”？", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-781-6-9", "zh": "如：pañcahupāli aṅgehi samannāgato（优波离，具足五支）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "14-781-10-12", "zh": "natthaññaṃ kiñci（没有其他任何东西）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "14-782-2-9", "zh": "16，18．前元音也变为长音。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "14-783-2-10", "zh": "后面的元音脱落之后，前面的元音有时也变为长音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-784-2-13", "zh": "如：kiṃsūdha vittaṃ purisassa seṭṭhaṃ（在这世间，什么是人最上的财富？）；sādhūti paṭissuṇitvā（回答“好的”之后）。为什么说“**有时**”？", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "14-784-14-16", "zh": "如：itissa muhuttampi（这样，他哪怕片刻）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "14-785-2-9", "zh": "17，19．词末的 e 替换为 y。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "14-786-2-10", "zh": "在后接元音时，位于词末的 e 有时替换为 y。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-787-2-14", "zh": "如：adhigato kho myāyaṃ dhammo（我已证得此法）；tyāhaṃ evaṃ vadeyyaṃ（我会这样对他们说）；tyāssa pahīnā honti（他的这些已被断除）。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "14-788-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**有时**”？", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-788-6-12", "zh": "如：ne ’nāgatā（他们未来到）；iti nettha（因此这里没有）。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "14-789-2-8", "zh": "18，20．词末的 o、u 替换为 v。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "14-790-2-9", "zh": "在后接元音时，位于词末的 o 和 u 有时替换为 v。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-791-2-14", "zh": "如：atha khvassa（于是他）；svassa hoti（他会有）；bahvābādho（多病的）；vatthvettha vihitaṃ niccaṃ（衣物常放在这里）；cakkhāpāthamāgacchati（进入眼的范围）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "14-792-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“有时”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-792-5-13", "zh": "如：cattāro ’me bhikkhave dhammā（比丘们，这四法）；kinnumāva samaṇiyo（这些莫非是沙门尼？）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-793-2-9", "zh": "19，22．整个变为 c。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "14-794-2-13", "zh": "“ti”这个音（如 **icceso**）整个作为辅音，在后接元音时有时变为 c。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "14-795-2-12", "zh": "如：iccetaṃ kusalaṃ（这样，这是善的）；iccassa vacanīyaṃ（应当这样对他说）；paccuttaritvā（返回上岸后）；paccāharati（带回来）。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "14-796-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**有时**”？", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-796-6-8", "zh": "如：itissa muhuttampi（这样，他哪怕片刻）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "14-797-2-10", "zh": "20，27．dh 也变为 d。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-798-2-10", "zh": "在后接元音时，dh 有时替换为 d。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-799-2-5", "zh": "如：ekamidāhaṃ bhikkhave samayaṃ（比丘们，有一次我在这里）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-800-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**有时**”？", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "14-800-6-9", "zh": "如：idheva maraṇaṃ bhavissati（就在这里将会死去）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-801-2-11", "zh": "由于规则中取了 va 这个词，dh 也替换为 h，如：sāhu dassanamariyānaṃ（见到圣者是好的）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "14-802-2-4", "zh": "通过对规则的分解，可以有多种替换：", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-803-2-6", "zh": "d 替换为 t，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-803-7-8", "zh": "sugato（善逝）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-804-2-6", "zh": "t 替换为 ṭ，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-804-7-8", "zh": "dukkaṭaṃ（恶作）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-805-2-6", "zh": "t 替换为 dh，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-805-7-8", "zh": "gandhabbo（乾达婆）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-806-2-6", "zh": "tt 替换为 tr，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-806-7-8", "zh": "atrajo（亲生子）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-807-2-6", "zh": "g 替换为 k，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-807-7-8", "zh": "kulūpako（常往来俗家的人）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "14-808-2-7", "zh": "r 替换为 l，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-808-8-9", "zh": "mahāsālo（大富豪）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-809-2-6", "zh": "y 替换为 j，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-809-7-8", "zh": "gavajo（野牛）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-810-2-6", "zh": "v 替换为 bb，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-810-7-8", "zh": "kubbato（正在做的）。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "14-811-2-6", "zh": "y 替换为 k，例如：", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "14-811-7-8", "zh": "sake（在自己的）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "14-812-2-6", "zh": "j 替换为 y，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-812-7-8", "zh": "niyaṃputtaṃ（亲生儿子）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-813-2-6", "zh": "t 替换为 k，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-813-7-8", "zh": "niyako（自己的）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-814-2-7", "zh": "tt 替换为 cc，例如 bhacco（仆人）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-815-2-6", "zh": "p 替换为 ph，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-815-7-8", "zh": "nipphatti（成就）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-816-2-6", "zh": "k 替换为 kh，例如：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-816-7-8", "zh": "nikkhamati（出去）。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-816-9-11", "zh": "其他诸如此类的情况，都应依此类推。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-817-2-10", "zh": "21，21．i 类元音变为 y，或者不变。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-818-2-10", "zh": "前面的 i 类元音在后接元音时变为 y，或者不变。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "14-818-11-15", "zh": "如：paṭisanthāravutyassa（他应以友善待人为行持）；sabbā vityānubhūyate（一切喜悦都被感受）。", "confidence": 62}
{"id": "14-819-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**或者不变**”？", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "14-819-6-11", "zh": "如：pañcahaṅgehi samannāgato（具足五支）；muttacāgī anuddhato（慷慨施舍，不掉举）。", "confidence": 72}
